よ、新たな『チョコ』とワタシを\n引き合わせてくれた太陽神の悪戯に感謝を捧げつつ、\n共にバレンタインを楽しもうじゃないか！","welcome":"チョコレートとは誠に素晴らしい菓子だな、王よ！\nインティへの捧げ物として、祭壇に祀ってみるのは\nどうだろうか。日頃世話になっているオマエに贈るのも、\n悪くないかもしれないな。","raw":{"CardID":792,"ClassID":10500,"DedicatedWeaponID":7022,"Rarity":7,"Tokusei1":11,"SkinGroupID":177,"VoiceID":797,"AreaType":12,"DotScale":1.0,"HealthCorrection":120,"AttackCorrection":120,"DefenseCorrection":120,"RegenerationCorrection":100,"GrowUpID":2,"GrowUpLimitType":999,"AbilityID":9792,"GimmickID":792,"CutInYCorrection":-200,"MaxRenovationCount":1,"RenovationType":4,"Renovation1AbilityID":10792,"Renovation1GimmickID":9792,"ExclusionVote":1,"AutoProtect":1}}